arguments are matched \strong{by name} to:
\itemize{
\item the outputs (for example \code{u}),
\item the domain variables (for example \code{x}, \code{t}),
\item the parameters in \code{parms} and \code{unknown}, and
\item \code{d}, the derivative operator.
